# Warnings

Since Conundrum came to be as I was homeless, I had to make a lot of less-than-ideal decisions during the development process that left things kind of a mess. I'm going to do my best to keep track of the bullet points here so that whenever Conundrum moves away from Fluster, we can move Conundrum to a community driven effort as smoothly as possible.


## Database

Currently, because Conundrum supports both chunking and complete document vectors to some degree, I took a slightly different approach to the way vectors are stored. 

When a model is permanent and unchanging, like documentation, 

```rs
pub struct SomeVectorBody {
    pub 
}
```
